### API 1: Send Message
POST http://localhost:3000/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: SMS Forwarder App

{
  "from": "Ashwin",
  "text": "Hello Ashwin!",
  "sim": "Jio"
}

### Recent message of each user
GET http://localhost:3000/messages

### Filter by sender
GET http://localhost:3000/messages?from=Ashwin

### Filter by SIM
GET http://localhost:3000/messages?sim=Jio

### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:3000/messages?from=Ashwin&sim=Jio




